Misc files
==========

apply-all.sh: Script to apply all saved SDK patches. Run it with the SDK
root as the argument.

busybox-reboot: Wrapper for busybox reboot commands. Installed in the
rootfs as `shutdown`/`halt`/`poweroff`/`reboot` to add support for the
`--halt`, `--poweroff` and `--reboot` options that busybox lacks.

kmsgrab.c: Tool for grabbing display buffer from DRM.
